  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup butternut squash seeds or other hard squash seeds",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 275 degrees F (135 degrees C). Line a baking sheet with parchment paper or aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4HONAq_mBYLFNQ9Mz4kE7D6mKhw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-54873-Roasted-Winter-Squash-Seeds-ddmfs-step-1-c5de976d135746bba0829653545561c3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/54873/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "After removing the seeds from the squash, rinse with water, and remove any strings and bits of squash. Pat seeds dry, and place in a small bowl; stir in olive oil and salt until evenly coated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/c6j9lczn60KnRnjHW0aiJqUEPmE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-54873-Roasted-Winter-Squash-Seeds-ddmfs-step-2-9289d286467f4feda88e8ea466e48bd0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/54873/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread seeds in an even layer on the prepared baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MoDmvZR7-MGkXb7VRAG6vRdwhAo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-54873-Roasted-Winter-Squash-Seeds-ddmfs-step-3-37f2ad2e03b743a38a8104bf0012936c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/54873/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 15 minutes, or until seeds start to pop. Remove from the oven; cool on the baking sheet before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9UmZNQZDQvtRL8EsTWHTcHN9zRc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-54873-Roasted-Winter-Squash-Seeds-ddmfs-step-4-c1a532ce49f0484e8539e0dffa362040.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/54873/step_04.webp"
    }
